1
00:00:01,939 --> 00:00:07,000
Black Cat, Tan Cat
黑猫，棕猫

2
00:00:08,978 --> 00:00:11,519
Look at Black Cat
看看黑猫

3
00:00:12,659 --> 00:00:14,599
He's on his mat
他在他的垫子上

4
00:00:15,859 --> 00:00:21,440
He's happy, fat, and glad
他快乐，肥胖，快乐

5
00:00:24,259 --> 00:00:26,960
Tan Cat walks by
谭猫走过

6
00:00:28,178 --> 00:00:30,920
his tail held high
他的尾巴高高举起

7
00:00:32,259 --> 00:00:37,119
And now Black Cat is mad
现在黑猫生气了

8
00:00:38,859 --> 00:00:44,240
He thinks Tan Cat  wants on his mat
他认为谭猫想上他的垫子

9
00:00:45,058 --> 00:00:48,920
Black Cat will never share
黑猫永远不会分享

10
00:01:20,299 --> 00:01:21,697
It is so sad
这太可悲了

11
00:01:21,698 --> 00:01:23,378
Tan Cat feels bad
谭猫感觉不好

12
00:01:23,379 --> 00:01:25,359
They could have been a pair
他们可能是一对

